# Divyavani Cursor Security & Architecture Rules (v3.0)
# NextToppers & Extramarks EdTech UI/UX + 3 Google Drive Vaults Edition

- Always validate inputs with Zod schemas.
- Sanitize HTML/KaTeX output with DOMPurify.
- Always use UUIDv4 for entity IDs and enforce RLS.
- Never place API secrets in client-side code.
- EdTech Design System: #F8FAFC Slate-50 canvas, #FFFFFF rounded-2xl cards, #4F46E5 Royal Indigo, #F97316 Coral Orange, #10B981 Emerald.
- Support the 3 Google Drive Chapter Vaults: 1-p63t_9hciCKCspwVJNNoUHsPpYVgX1e, 1KcZbtN5ij-19L8SkS6AjLqaLdwzP2sX4, 1lEU75-5NTwcfQGSfUFu3_ARibYVDyHbl.
- Keep visible focus rings for WCAG 2.1 AA keyboard accessibility.
